#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><title>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/qt5-components.xml:121
#, xml-text
msgid "Installation of qt5 components"
msgstr "Instalação dos Componentes do qt5"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/qt5-components.xml:124
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"There are a few extra components needed for different packages in BLFS.  "
"These are <emphasis role=\"bold\">qtimageformats</emphasis>, <emphasis "
"role=\"bold\">qtlocation</emphasis>, <emphasis "
"role=\"bold\">qtwebchannel</emphasis>, <emphasis "
"role=\"bold\">qtdoc</emphasis>, and <emphasis "
"role=\"bold\">qtmultimedia</emphasis>.  Only those components specified for "
"a specific package are needed. You only need to build the relevant "
"component(s)."
msgstr ""
"Existem uns poucos componentes extras necessários para diferentes pacotes no"
" BLFS. Esses são <emphasis role=\"bold\">qtimageformats</emphasis>, "
"<emphasis role=\"bold\">qtlocation</emphasis>, <emphasis "
"role=\"bold\">qtwebchannel</emphasis>, <emphasis "
"role=\"bold\">qtdoc</emphasis> e <emphasis "
"role=\"bold\">qtmultimedia</emphasis>. Somente aqueles componentes "
"especificados para um pacote específico são necessários. Você só precisa "
"construir o(s) componente(s) relevante(s)."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/qt5-components.xml:136
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"First, apply a patch to pull in the fixes curated by KDE for some of the "
"modules listed above:"
msgstr ""
"Primeiro, aplique um remendo para obter as correções selecionadas pelo KDE "
"para alguns dos módulos listados acima:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/qt5-components.xml:140
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput remap=\"pre\">patch -Np1 -i ../qt-everywhere-opensource-"
"src-&qt5-version;-kf5-1.patch</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput remap=\"pre\">patch -Np1 -i ../qt-everywhere-opensource-"
"src-&qt5-version;-kf5-1.patch</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/qt5-components.xml:143
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Next, if you are installing <emphasis role=\"bold\">qtlocation</emphasis>, "
"fix the build with GCC-13:"
msgstr ""
"A seguir, se você estiver instalando o <emphasis "
"role=\"bold\">qtlocation</emphasis>, corrija a construção com GCC-13:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/qt5-components.xml:147
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>sed -e \"/pragma once/a#include &lt;cstdint&gt;\"                                      \\\n"
"    -i qtlocation/src/3rdparty/mapbox-gl-native/include/mbgl/util/geometry.hpp \\\n"
"       qtlocation/src/3rdparty/mapbox-gl-native/include/mbgl/util/string.hpp   \\\n"
"       qtlocation/src/3rdparty/mapbox-gl-native/src/mbgl/gl/stencil_mode.hpp</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>sed -e \"/pragma once/a#include &lt;cstdint&gt;\"                                      \\\n"
"    -i qtlocation/src/3rdparty/mapbox-gl-native/include/mbgl/util/geometry.hpp \\\n"
"       qtlocation/src/3rdparty/mapbox-gl-native/include/mbgl/util/string.hpp   \\\n"
"       qtlocation/src/3rdparty/mapbox-gl-native/src/mbgl/gl/stencil_mode.hpp</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/qt5-components.xml:153
#, xml-text
msgid "Install each desired component by running the following commands:"
msgstr "Instale cada componente desejado executando os seguintes comandos:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/qt5-components.xml:156
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>cd <replaceable>&lt;component&gt;</replaceable>\n"
"qmake <replaceable>&lt;component&gt;</replaceable>.pro\n"
"make</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>cd <replaceable>&lt;componente&gt;</replaceable>\n"
"qmake <replaceable>&lt;componente&gt;</replaceable>.pro\n"
"make</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/qt5-components.xml:161
#, xml-text
msgid "As the &root; user:"
msgstr "Como o(a) usuário(a) &root;:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/qt5-components.xml:164
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid "<userinput>make install</userinput>"
msgstr "<userinput>make install</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/qt5-components.xml:170
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Remove references to the build directory from installed library dependency "
"(prl) files by running the following command as the &root; user:"
msgstr ""
"Remova as referências para o diretório de construção dos arquivos instalados"
" de dependência de biblioteca (prl) executando o seguinte comando como o(a) "
"usuário(a) &root;:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/qt5-components.xml:175
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>find $QT5DIR/ -name \\*.prl \\\n"
"   -exec sed -i -e '/^QMAKE_PRL_BUILD_DIR/d' {} \\;</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>find $QT5DIR/ -name \\*.prl \\\n"
"   -exec sed -i -e '/^QMAKE_PRL_BUILD_DIR/d' {} \\;</userinput>"

